\f0\fs24 \cf0 SS DELPHINE \'96 A New Chapter Begins\
\
Built in 1921 for the Dodge family, SS Delphine is widely regarded as one of the world's most remarkable historic yachts. More than a century later, she remains the last operational privately owned steam yacht of her size, representing a unique piece of maritime heritage.\
\
In November 2024, Maxime Berisset from the company VIENA MB as a rep owner and project manager was appointed to be in charge of the whole refit.\
\
The yacht was found in very poor conditions in Marseille and dismantled from every corner by the shipyard.\
\
After more than eighteen months of intensive work, Delphine has recently completed one of the most comprehensive refits in her modern history.\
\
This was far more than a cosmetic restoration. The objective was to preserve her authenticity while ensuring she meets today's operational, technical and safety standards.\
\
The project involved hundreds of specialists, engineers, craftsmen and marine professionals working together on virtually every aspect of the vessel.\
\
Her steam propulsion plant, the heart of Delphine's identity, has undergone extensive maintenance and restoration, ensuring that the yacht continues to operate exactly as she was originally designed, something almost impossible to experience anywhere else in the world.\
\
Major structural work, engineering upgrades, mechanical overhauls, electrical improvements, navigation systems, safety equipment and onboard services have all been addressed throughout the refit.\
\
Particular attention has been given to preserving the yacht's historical character. Original details have been restored wherever possible, while modern technology has been discreetly integrated to improve reliability, comfort and operational efficiency.\
\
The successful completion of recent sea trials marks a major milestone in Delphine's return to service. These trials demonstrated the performance of her propulsion systems and confirmed the significant progress achieved throughout the refit.\
\
Today, SS Delphine combines the elegance and craftsmanship of the Golden Age of yachting with the reliability expected of a modern operational vessel.\
\
Very few yachts in the world can offer such an authentic steam navigation experience while providing the comfort and refinement expected by today's owners and guests.\
\
Beyond being an extraordinary yacht, Delphine is a floating museum, an engineering masterpiece and a living symbol of maritime history.\
\
Her restoration has required passion, patience and an unwavering commitment to preserving one of the world's last great steam yachts for future generations.\
\
With this exceptional refit now largely completed, SS Delphine enters an exciting new chapter\'97ready once again to cruise the Mediterranean and beyond, carrying forward more than a century of history while embracing the future.\
\
The rebirth of SS Delphine is not simply the restoration of a yacht; it is the revival of a legend.\
